e/bevy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy","homepage":"https://bevy.org","size":153505,"stargazers_count":43454,"watchers_count":43454,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":4270,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3179,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["bevy","game-development","game-engine","gamedev","open-source","rust"],"visibility":"public","forks":4270,"open_issues":3179,"watchers":43454,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"**Bevy version**\r\n\r\nCommit: 4825051c6a2faf097ff3976db10e06b782f04056\r\n\r\nAlso tried Bevy 0.4 as crate dependency for a new project. I also tried downgrading to 0.3 and using that.\r\n\r\n**Operating system & version**\r\n\r\nmacOS Catalina 10.15.7\r\n\r\nSome outputs of build tools, if relevant:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ xcode-select --version\r\nxcode-select version 2373.\r\n❯ clang --version\r\nApple clang version 12.0.0 (clang-1200.0.32.28)\r\nTarget: x86_64-apple-darwin19.6.0\r\nThread model: posix\r\nInstalledDir: /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr/bin\r\n❯ gcc --version\r\nConfigured with: --prefix=/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr --with-gxx-include-dir=/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/SDKs/MacOSX10.15.sdk/usr/include/c++/4.2.1\r\nApple clang version 12.0.0 (clang-1200.0.32.28)\r\nTarget: x86_64-apple-darwin19.6.0\r\nThread model: posix\r\nInstalledDir: /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/usr/bin\r\n❯ rustc --version\r\nrustc 1.48.0 (7eac88abb 2020-11-16)\r\n❯ cargo --version\r\ncargo 1.48.0 (65cbdd2dc 2020-10-14)\r\n❯ rustup --version\r\nrustup 1.23.1 (3df2264a9 2020-11-30)\r\ninfo: This is the version for the rustup toolchain manager, not the rustc compiler.\r\ninfo: The currently active `rustc` version is `rustc 1.48.0 (7eac88abb 2020-11-16)`\r\n```\r\n\r\n**What you did**\r\n\r\n```\r\ngit clone https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/\r\ncd bevy\r\ncargo run --example breakout\r\n```\r\n\r\nJust like [this issue](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/205#issue-679734119), not sure why it worked for them on Big Sur but not Catalina.\r\n\r\n**What you expected to happen**\r\n\r\nBevy compiles (and hopefully runs).\r\n\r\n**What actually happened**\r\n\r\n```\r\n  error occurred: Command \"c++\" \"-O0\" \"-ffunction-sections\" \"-fdata-sections\" \"-fPIC\" \"-g\" \"-fno-omit-frame-pointer\" \"-m64\" \"-arch\" \"x86_64\" \"-Wall\" \"-Wextra\" \"-DSPIRV_CROSS_EXCEPTIONS_TO_ASSERTIONS\" \"-DSPIRV_CROSS_WRAPPER_NO_EXCEPTIONS\" \"-DSPIRV_CROSS_WRAPPER_GLSL\" \"-DSPIRV_CROSS_WRAPPER_HLSL\" \"-DSPIRV_CROSS_WRAPPER_MSL\" \"-std=c++14\" \"-o\" \"/Users/noah.masur/dev/personal/bevy/target/debug/build/spirv_cross-4e1f87dc011b4055/out/src/wrapper.o\" \"-c\" \"src/wrapper.cpp\" with args \"c++\" did not execute successfully (status code exit code: 1).\r\n\r\n\r\nwarning: build failed, waiting for other jobs to finish...\r\nerror: build failed\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Additional information**\r\n\r\nI tried reinstalling the latest macOS Command Line Tools by running:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsudo rm -rf /Library/Developer/CommandLineTools\r\nxcode-select --install\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis didn't do anything. I assume there are some kind of missing build requirements, such as the ones described in the [Linux dependencies document](https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/blob/master/docs/linux_dependencies.md). Do we know what the equivalent macOS dependencies are? Do they expect to extend beyond Cargo and the Xcode CLI tools?\r\n\r\nThanks!","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0